TEXT -128 -48 Left 2 ;Gain-Controlled Balanced Output (Rev 2, sim/output/gain-controlled-output.asc)
TEXT -128 -24 Left 2 ;Seed audio out -> OPA1656 inverting gain -> THAT1646 emulation -> XLR w/ phantom clamps
TEXT 48 664 Left 2 ;Seed full-scale: 2Vpp sine (1V amplitude), 100R source
TEXT 176 112 Left 2 ;OPA1656 inverting stage\n;gain = -R_fb/R_in\n;Vhigh/Vlow set rail clip\n;at +/-11V (OPA1656 RRO)
TEXT 944 -216 Left 2 ;THAT1646 emulation (behavioural):\n;E_hot  = LIMIT(+V(OPA_Out), +/-10.5V)\n;E_cold = LIMIT(-V(OPA_Out), +/-10.5V)\n;Differential out = V(XLR_Hot) - V(XLR_Cold) = 2*V(OPA_Out) until clip
TEXT 944 -112 Left 2 ;Phantom-power protection clamps (SM4004, modelled 1N4004).\n;Each XLR pin clamped to +/-12V rails.
TEXT -128 720 Left 2 !.param vamp=1\n.param rin=2.2k\n;uncomment to sweep gain and find clean ceiling:\n;.step param rfb list 4.4k 6.6k 11k 13k 15k 22k 25k\n.param rfb=18k
TEXT -128 912 Left 2 !.tran 0 10m 5m 1u\n.four 1000 V(XLR_Hot,XLR_Cold)
TEXT -128 960 Left 2 !.meas tran opa_pp pp V(OPA_Out)\n.meas tran opa_max max V(OPA_Out)\n.meas tran opa_min min V(OPA_Out)\n.meas tran hot_pp pp V(XLR_Hot)\n.meas tran diff_pp pp V(XLR_Hot,XLR_Cold)\n.meas tran diff_max max V(XLR_Hot,XLR_Cold)\n.meas tran diff_min min V(XLR_Hot,XLR_Cold)
TEXT -128 1168 Left 2 ;Expected: at rfb=13k (gain 5.9x) the OPA1656 output ~11.8Vpp,\n;differential XLR ~23.6 Vpp = 8.3 Vrms = +20.6 dBu peak (clean).\n;At rfb>=15k the OPA hits Vhigh/Vlow (+/-11V) -> clipped.\n;At rfb=25k differential hits THAT1646 limit (2*10.5 = 21 Vpp).
TEXT 480 1056 Left 2 !.model 1N4004 D(Is=14.11n N=1.984 Rs=33.89m Ikf=94.81 Xti=3 Eg=1.11 Cjo=25.89p M=0.44 Vj=0.3245 Fc=0.5  Isr=1.565n Nr=2 Bv=400 Ibv=10u Tt=5.7u)
